     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\">This solves your color issue:</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">ggplot(DF,aes(x=x,y=y,group=year,colour=as.factor(year)))+</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\" size=\"1\">  geom_line(size=2)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">I&#39;m not very good with scales, so I&#39;m unsure how to do a translation on the scale. :/ </div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">B</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Oct 23, 2014 at 7:39 AM, Alessandra Carioli <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">alessand...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden\">ggplot(DF,aes(x=x,y=y,group=year,colour=year))+<br>\r\n  geom_line(size=2)</div></blockquote></div><br><br></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
